15
01:06:00,000 --> 01:06:06,000
The story of Wanted revolves around Wesley Allan Gibson, who decides to join the Fraternity, a secret
society of assassins, after learning that his father was a member of the Fraternity.

16
01:10:24,000 --> 01:10:30,000
Universal Pictures acquired the adaptation rights from Millar in 2004, and while the eventual script drifted from the comic book
superhero mythos in the original miniseries, he was content to see most of the comic's darker content retained.

17
01:14:48,000 --> 01:14:54,000
Production began in April 2007, with filming in the Czech Republic,
Budapest, and the story's main setting, Chicago.

18
01:19:12,000 --> 01:19:18,000
Bekmambetov's production company, Bazelevs Production,
provided the majority of the film's visual effects.

19
01:23:36,000 --> 01:23:42,000
Danny Elfman scored the film, employing a guitar-based musical score.

20
01:28:00,000 --> 01:28:06,000
Wanted opened on June 27, 2008, to generally positive reviews with praise
for its fast-pace narrative and stylized action sequences.

21
01:32:24,000 --> 01:32:30,000
The film grossed $342 million worldwide.

22
